'''Interrogation Six''' was an [[Torture|interrogation]] cell located aboard the [[First Order]] [[Resurgent-class Star Destroyer|Star Destroyer]] [[Steadfast (Resurgent-class)|''Steadfast'']]. After the [[Wookiee]] [[Chewbacca]] was captured, he was taken to Interrogation Six.<ref name="TROS Expanded" />

